{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113300","id":3055162536,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62GhSo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113300","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113300.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113300.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113300","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113300/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113300/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113300/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fc79b3c11593f268273255032bc9f0c48067af61","number":113300,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"MacOS: Fix focus grab warning on macOS when running game in embedded mode.","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes focus grab warning on macOS when running game in embedded mode.\r\n\r\n## Issue\r\n<img width=\"1490\" height=\"964\" alt=\"图片\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77abffb0-d883-4ee4-977b-9c981e4cea4c\" />\r\n\r\nWhen running a game with \"Embed Game on Next Play\" enabled on macOS, the following warning is printed:\r\n\"This control can't grab focus. Use set_focus_mode() and set_focus_behavior_recursive() \r\nto allow a control to get focus.\"\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n`EmbeddedProcessMacOS` is explicitly configured with `set_focus_mode(FOCUS_NONE)` in its constructor,\r\nwhile `GameView` unconditionally calls `grab_focus()` on it when starting the game instance.\r\n\r\nThe focus is intentionally delegated to the child `layer_host` which uses `FOCUS_ALL`.\r\nHowever, `grab_focus()` on the parent process still triggers the warning even though this\r\nis the intended design on macOS.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nAdd a focus mode check before calling `grab_focus()` in `GameView::_play_pressed()` and\r\n`GameView::_instance_starting()`. This prevents the warning when the control is explicitly\r\nset to not accept focus, matching the macOS-specific implementation's design.\r\n\r\n### Changes Made\r\n- Added `if (embedded_process->get_focus_mode_with_override() != FOCUS_NONE)` guard\r\n  before `embedded_process->grab_focus()` calls in `game_view.cpp`\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Tested on macOS: warning no longer appears when launching game in embedded mode\r\n- Verified other platforms (Windows/Linux) remain unaffected\r\n- Confirmed focus behavior still works correctly in embedded game window","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-29T01:16:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:36:16Z","closed_at":"2025-12-01T10:55:34Z","merged_at":"2025-12-01T10:55:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"c7ae694d6bb753e18e27ce09ac2172c356e